  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IMR - DIHR 2026-2030: In Defence of Fundamental Values: Realizing Human Rights, Justice, and Equality for All</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will ensure governance is based on international human rights norms and standards and that citizens, individuals and affected groups assert their rights and have equal access to rights fulfilment. This will be done through support to national human rights systems and to academia and civil society. The project will also contribute to increasing responsible business conduct. The support is aligned with Danish development priorities, including a focus on human rights and the most vulnerable, including women and girls. The project will among other be implemented in key Danish priority areas, e.g. Africa and Eastern neighbouring countries, and other.</narrative>
  </description>
